                "5": "With more money comes more responsibility, but due to a lack of patience and mental stability, you will not be able to deploy your money effectively. This kind of situation will give rise to profession-related stress which will reflect on your family, health, and children.\n\nSun\u2019s placement will increase your potential and you will help your family and children with your intellectual knowledge. You will have happiness in your married life, and you will get a chance to make open heart conversation with your partner which you were longing to share with your companion.",
                "6": "You will receive unwanted work responsibilities and delay in expected result. However, this placement will be good for introspection so that you will not get stuck in challenges. You will solve your problem and investigate the root cause of it while learning how to achieve success in your job. Your command and respect will increase as influential people will enter your circle.\n\nYour social life and reputation will expand the happiness of your family and children. You will be able to fulfil the responsibilities towards your family. Sun\u2019s placement will increase your energy level by involving you in physical fitness and improved lifestyle. You will have increased stamina and a positive attitude towards your health.",
                "7": "You may face delays and aggressive changes in your plan which will bring emotional challenges that can affect you on the professional front. You might face abdominal pain due to stomach and digestion related issues. There will be a rise in finance and growth in your career by making wise decisions and implementing innovative ideas.\n\nSun\u2019s placement will influence you to be more vocal about the present situation, and it will also influence the decision-making ability. You might make bold decisions which will affect your long-term finances. This placement might make you feel strengthened and empowered, but do not get overwhelmed and get into arguments and clashes in your personal and professional upfront.",
                "8": "The placement of Sun might give you trouble from seniors and might increase competition in your workplace. You will support your team members to accomplish the targets on time, which will endow respect and gratitude in your work.\n\nYou will have determined and hardworking people in your team. You will focus on heartfelt experiences rather than obsessing over romantic and sexual life. You will struggle in your married life as your equation will never match with your partner.",
                "9": "You can shine in your career if you let go of your ego and pride. You are inclined to plan good strategies and thus successfully close the deals on time. You will develop the resilience to deal with professional stress without taking mental pressure.\n\nYou will be in a content and satisfied environment with your family, children, and friends. You may not have a harmonious relationship with your father and this placement will affect his health. You will be spiritually elevated and will have many gurus.",
                "10": "In your workplace, you will get good opportunities to get out of your hectic workload by delegating work to everyone. You will have many innovative ideas to take your career to the next level. The planetary combinations will give you mental clarity and you will have clear thoughts to make important decisions.\n\nYou will be able to prove your point in an impressive way. Due to worry and stress, your health might get disturbed, and you may suffer from the agony of pain and food intolerance. You might also face cholesterol related problems.",
                "11": "Placement of Sun will make it difficult for you to acknowledge your stubbornness and recognize the pride in you. You will fulfill the responsibilities of your married life with pleasure and happiness.\n\nIt might create hormonal related problems and urinary infection. It is advised to drink lots of water and increase your fruit intake. You will be overburdened with work, take the leap of faith, and wholeheartedly embrace the flow of work.",
                "12": "The sun will bestow you with leadership qualities to take proactive planning which can enhance your creative experience at your workplace. Over expectation in your personal and professional life might put your moral down.\n\nSun\u2019s placement will disturb your structured way of communication into shrewd and hurtful one. You will have disturbed sleep and your mind will always be stuck in thoughts. The planetary position might create hormonal changes and will divert your attention towards healthy diet and exercises. You will be inclined towards yoga and meditation."
